Analysis: The ratio F_n*sqrt(5)/L_n converges to 1 as n -> infinity.
This is because phi^n dominates and psi^n -> 0, so:
  F_n*sqrt(5) = phi^n - psi^n  ~  phi^n
  L_n         = phi^n + psi^n  ~  phi^n
The correction is psi^n = (-1/phi)^n which ALTERNATES and decays.

Exact: F_n*sqrt(5)/L_n = (phi^n - psi^n)/(phi^n + psi^n)
     = (1 - (psi/phi)^n) / (1 + (psi/phi)^n)
     psi/phi = -0.3819660113 = -1/phi^2 = -(3-sqrt(5))/2

PARITY EFFECT:
  n= 1: F*s5=      2.2361, L=     1  =>  F*s5 > L  (odd n: psi^n < 0)
  n= 2: F*s5=      2.2361, L=     3  =>  L > F*s5  (even n: psi^n > 0)
  n= 3: F*s5=      4.4721, L=     4  =>  F*s5 > L  (odd n: psi^n < 0)
  n= 4: F*s5=      6.7082, L=     7  =>  L > F*s5  (even n: psi^n > 0)
