F_n*sqrt(5) first exceeds L_n at n = 1

This happens ONLY at odd n!
At even n: L_n = phi^n + psi^n > phi^n - psi^n = F_n*sqrt(5) since psi^n > 0.
At odd n:  L_n = phi^n + psi^n < phi^n - psi^n = F_n*sqrt(5) since psi^n < 0.
So for ALL odd n >= 1: F_n*sqrt(5) > L_n, and the margin is 2*|psi|^n.

Verification: margin = F_n*sqrt(5) - L_n = -2*psi^n = 2/phi^n for odd n
  n= 1: margin = 1.2360679775, 2/phi^n = 1.2360679775, match = True
  n= 3: margin = 0.4721359550, 2/phi^n = 0.4721359550, match = True
  n= 5: margin = 0.1803398875, 2/phi^n = 0.1803398875, match = True
