SECTION 6: The alternating correction (-1/phi)^n and quasicrystal beat
========================================================================

L_n = phi^n + psi^n, where psi = -1/phi.
So L_n = phi^n + (-1)^n / phi^n.
The correction epsilon_n = psi^n = (-1/phi)^n oscillates and decays.

